usage: Evaluate predications on SWEFT bugs [-h] [-d DATASET_PATH]
                                           [-p PREDICTIONS_PATH]
                                           [--run_id RUN_ID] [-w WORKERS]
                                           [--redo_existing]
                                           [-i INSTANCE_IDS [INSTANCE_IDS ...]]
                                           [-f] [--report_only]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -d DATASET_PATH, --dataset_path DATASET_PATH
                        Path to dataset
  -p PREDICTIONS_PATH, --predictions_path PREDICTIONS_PATH
                        Path to predictions
  --run_id RUN_ID       Unique identifier for this run
  -w WORKERS, --workers WORKERS
                        Number of workers to use
  --redo_existing       Redo completed evaluation instances
  -i INSTANCE_IDS [INSTANCE_IDS ...], --instance_ids INSTANCE_IDS [INSTANCE_IDS ...]
                        Instance IDs to evaluate (supports exact matches and
                        glob patterns like 'repo__name.*')
  -f, --f2p_only        (Speed up) Run evaluation using only files with f2p
                        tests
  --report_only         Regenerate reports only
